  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "UNEVIDENCED — read, not proven",
      "items": [
        "Drawn by dev:arch from reading the code at dev-desk b9f8c01, 2026-09-21",
        "Archify's repository evidence is architecture-only, so no node here is pinned to a file and line",
        "Nothing re-checks this drawing; treat every node as an assertion, not a citation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "One intent, one prompt",
      "items": [
        "Dev Desk never runs a door itself — it shells out dev run, which builds the prompt",
        "A typed /dev door skips dev run and reaches the same agent with the same words",
        "The door is prose the agent executes; the shared contract is what bounds where it may write"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Three stores, two readers",
      "items": [
        ".dev/<branch>.json is machine-local and self-ignored; docs/ is committed; the tracker is shared",
        "dev board and Dev Desk read the same three and are meant to render the same board",
        "The tracker closes the loop: what a create-* door writes is what the next run reads as input"
      ]
    }
